<title>USA: VECTRA appoints Franceschi president, COO.</title>
<headline>VECTRA appoints Franceschi president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>VECTRA Technologies Inc said Tuesday that Vincent Franceschi, the general manager of its fuels group, has been appointed president and chief operating officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company, which supplies technologies and services to the nuclear power industry, said Ray Fortney will continue as chief executive officer through a transition period of about sixty days and remain as a company director and consultant.</p>
</text>
